## Resources are NOT required here via $webResourceManager: the equivalent
## call in admin.vm silently emitted nothing (variable absent from the
## template context), so this template does not gamble on the same mechanism.
## Instead, panel-resources declares <context>jira.view.issue</context> in
## atlassian-plugin.xml and Jira auto-loads the bundle on every issue view;
## the bundle itself defers mounting until DOM-ready, so head-vs-body load
## order does not matter.
<div id="testplanit-panel"
     data-issue-key="$issue.key"
     data-issue-id="$issue.id"
     data-base-url="$requestContext.baseUrl"></div>
